    Parameters
    ----------
    value
        The value to validate.
    path
        The path to this value (for error messages). Dict keys use dotted
        notation (e.g. ``outer.inner``) and list elements use bracket indexing
        (e.g. ``outer.inner[2]``).

    Raises
    ------
    TypeError
        If the value has an unsupported type.
