        Parameters
        ----------
        session_id
            The ID of the session that owns the files.
        file_ids
            The sequence of ids associated with files to retrieve.

        Returns
        -------
        List[UploadedFileRec]
            A list of URL UploadedFileRec instances, each instance contains information
            about uploaded file.
