    )r␀␀␀Úinstance©␀ó␀␀␀␀úG/etf-runtime/lib/python3.12/site-packages/streamlit/runtime/__init__.pyÚget_instancer␀␀␀␀␀␀s␀␀␀€␀ô␀×ÑÓÐr␀␀␀c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ó*␀␀␀—␀t␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀«␀␀␀␀␀␀␀S␀)a␀␀True if the singleton Runtime instance has been created.

    When a Streamlit app is running in "raw mode" - that is, when the
    app is run via `python app.py` instead of `streamlit run app.py` -
